n-your-computer)"], ["+", "*   [Opera⁠](https://help.opera.com/en/latest/web-preferences/#cookies%E2%81%A0%E2%81%A0)"], [" ", ""], [" ", "Please note that changes you make to your cookie settings may affect the availability or functionality of the Services. Cookies listed as “Necessary” are required for the Services to function and cannot be disabled."]]}]}